# Migration hashes normalise line endings, but finalize writes a migration's
# files LF: keep SQL, JSON and Markdown (HAND-EDITED.md) LF in every checkout
# so files never show up as changed on Windows.
*.sql text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
# A snapshot's diff is stored byte for byte: a line in it can end in a
# carriage return of the desired schema's own, which converting line endings
# would lose without changing the migration's hash.
desired-schema.diff -text
